config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_110_QIBAN_GPS_RECEIVER
	bool "Qiban GPS receiver (phone GPS bridge)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable a lightweight HTTP server that receives GPS coordinates
		from a phone browser and writes them to the location state file.
